graph TD
    A[Nutrient Limitation] --> B[TORC1 Inhibition]
    B --> C[Atg1 Activation]
    C --> D[Atg13 Dephosphorylation]
    D --> E[Atg1-Atg13 Complex]
    E --> F[Atg17 Recruitment]
    F --> G[PAS Formation]
    G --> H[Atg9 Vesicle Recruitment]
    H --> I[Atg2-Atg18 Complex]
    I --> J[Phosphatidylinositol Synthesis]
    J --> K[Autophagosome Initiation]
    K --> L[Autophagy Initiation Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> M[Stress Signal]
    M --> N[TORC1 Inhibition]
    N --> O[Autophagy Induction]
    O --> C
    
    %% Regulation
    L --> P[Autophagy Status]
    P --> Q{Nutrients Available?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[Autophagy Inhibition]
    Q -->|No| S[Autophagy Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    T[TORC1] --> B
    U[Atg1] --> C
    V[Atg13] --> D
    W[Atg17] --> F
    X[Atg9] --> H
    Y[Atg2] --> I
    Z[Atg18] --> I
    AA[PAS] --> G
    
